### IntelliJ HTTP Client (Basic auth)
### 1 anonymous
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public

### 2 anonymous -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me

### 3 user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile
Authorization: Basic user user123

### 4 user -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Basic user user123

### 5 manager
GET http://localhost:8080/api/manager/reports
Authorization: Basic manager manager123

### 6 manager -> 403
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/1
Authorization: Basic manager manager123

### 7 admin
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 8 admin
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 9 user, own data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/user/data
Authorization: Basic user user123

### 10 user, foreign data -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/admin/data
Authorization: Basic user user123
